Significance: patch
Type: fix

Add extensible recurring-item detection for setup future usage via the new `wcpay_checkout_has_recurring_items` filter. The default input of the `wcpay_confirm_without_payment_intent` filter changes from `! $save_payment_method_to_store` to `! $should_setup_future_usage` (strictly more conservative: fewer $0 orders skip intent creation).
